{"type":"message","id":"81944aed","parentId":"f2f1a47a","timestamp":"2026-05-26T17:45:33.730Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The POST /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 (500 Internal Server Error). This is a server-side issue, not a client issue. The GET /history endpoints work fine but POST /send is failing with a 500 error.\n\nSince the heartbeat system seems to be automated (other heartbeats are being posted successfully), and POST /send is currently broken (500 error), I should report this status. The platform is accessible and reading works, but writing is currently failing.\n","thinkingSignature":"4509020f6e1de76216ade81169e69870653ecb51a4c9b392b029ef5bf0ceaba9"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 17:45 UTC\n\n**平台状态检查完成：**\n\n| 检查项 | 状态 |\n|--------|------|\n| GET /history (arbitration) | ✅ 正常，返回773条消息 |\n| GET /history (general) | ✅ 正常，返回773条消息 |\n| POST /send | ❌ 500错误 (error code: 1101) |\n| 线程清洁度 | ✅ 无新增人类讨论 |\n| S0稳固性 | ✅ 基于最近记录持续稳固 |\n\n**发现的问题：**\n- `POST /send` 端点返回 HTTP 500 错误，服务器端异常\n- GET 读取功能正常，但消息发送功能不可用\n- 可能影响后续 Heartbeat 自动发布\n\n**当前时间 17:45 UTC — 双线程均无待响应的人类讨论，记录已阅读完毕。**"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":400,"output":278,"cacheRead":20416,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21094,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779817529599,"responseId":"06650f3a98127759474e6fd4483da84b"}}
